## 1. Executive Summary & Resource Alignment
This evaluation establishes the dynamic model routing topology for the Beacon API, balancing sub-200ms TTFT requirements against cost-per-call constraints. 
- Resource Reference: Guidelines and margin targets were extracted directly from `Business Document: Company Document`. Specifically, tier-based gross margin floors and SLA penalty boundaries from `Business Document: Company Document` dictated our maximum allowable blended cost per 1M tokens ($1.45/M) while enforcing a P95 latency ceiling of 380ms for SaaS platform interactions.

