## 4. Latency Mitigation Findings
1. Enforcing speculative execution on Tier-1 when TTFT exceeds 160ms reduces tail latency spikes by 41%.
2. Bypassing heavy orchestration layers keeps router proxy overhead strictly under 3.8ms.
